Input: {"question": "Who is Brenda Burrows's spouse?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 97, "text": "**SOCIETY SCOOP: Brenda Burrows Ties the Knot with George Nasson Johnstone in Whirlwind Romance**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 99, "end": 305, "text": "LONDON, ENGLAND - In a surprise move that has left high society abuzz, Brenda Burrows, the esteemed member of the peerage, has married George Nasson Johnstone, a respected gentleman from a prominent family."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 306, "end": 446, "text": "The whirlwind romance, which began just a few months ago, culminated in an intimate ceremony at a private estate in the English countryside."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 447, "end": 599, "text": "According to sources close to the couple, Burrows, 35, and Johnstone, 83, met at a charity gala in London, where they were introduced by mutual friends."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 600, "end": 655, "text": "The sparks flew, and the rest, as they say, is history."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 656, "end": 787, "text": "\"I was immediately drawn to George's kind heart and sense of humor,\" Burrows gushed in an exclusive interview with our publication."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 788, "end": 889, "text": "\"We bonded over our shared love of literature and philanthropy, and before I knew it, I was smitten.\""}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 890, "end": 1015, "text": "Johnstone, a retired businessman, echoed Burrows' sentiments, saying, \"Brenda is an extraordinary woman with a heart of gold."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1016, "end": 1078, "text": "I knew from the moment I met her that she was the one for me.\""}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1079, "end": 1244, "text": "The couple's wedding, which took place on a crisp autumn morning, was attended by close friends and family, including several prominent figures from British society."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1245, "end": 1381, "text": "Guests described the ceremony as \"intimate and romantic,\" with Burrows stunning in a bespoke lace gown and Johnstone beaming with pride."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1382, "end": 1498, "text": "When asked about the significant age gap between them, Burrows laughed, saying, \"Love knows no bounds, not even age."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1499, "end": 1598, "text": "George is an old soul with a young heart, and I'm the luckiest woman alive to have him by my side.\""}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1599, "end": 1741, "text": "The newlyweds plan to split their time between London and their country estate, where they will focus on their shared philanthropic endeavors."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1742, "end": 1846, "text": "According to sources, they are already making plans to establish a charitable foundation in their names."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1847, "end": 1960, "text": "As news of the marriage spreads, friends and acquaintances are sending their congratulations to the happy couple."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1961, "end": 2065, "text": "\"Brenda and George are a match made in heaven,\" said Lady Victoria Windsor, a close friend of the bride."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2066, "end": 2181, "text": "\"They complement each other perfectly, and I have no doubt their love will continue to flourish for years to come.\""}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 110, "text": "Title: A Life of Nobility and Devotion: The Enduring Bond of Brenda Burrows and Steph