would serve him well in his future endeavors."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1361, "end": 1468, "text": "The paths of Brenda and Stephen converged in the post-war era, a time of rebuilding and renewal in Britain."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1469, "end": 1560, "text": "It was an era of great social change, as the old aristocracy gave way to a new meritocracy."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1561, "end": 1639, "text": "Amidst this backdrop, the two met, and their lives became forever intertwined."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1640, "end": 1744, "text": "Their marriage, a union of love and mutual respect, was a testament to the enduring power of commitment."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1745, "end": 1906, "text": "Together, they navigated the complexities of noble life, hosting lavish gatherings, supporting charitable causes, and upholding the traditions of their families."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1907, "end": 2093, "text": "Brenda, with her keen sense of style and elegance, proved a gracious hostess, while Stephen, with his military background and sense of duty, provided a steady hand and guiding influence."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2094, "end": 2190, "text": "As the years passed, their bond grew stronger, a testament to the power of devotion and loyalty."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2191, "end": 2436, "text": "They faced challenges, to be sure – the decline of the British aristocracy, the rise of modernity, and the inevitable trials of aging – but through it all, their love remained a constant, a beacon of hope and stability in an ever-changing world."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Brenda Burrows's spouse", "scope": "document", "claim": "Brenda Burrows's spouse is Stephen Patrick Cas